          "value": "{}<p><em>See: @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.equipment.Item.dmgScrollOfProte]</em></p> <p>Using a Magic action to read the scroll creates a 5-foot Emanation originating from you. For 5 minutes, creatures of the specified type can’t enter or affect anything in the area. However, if you move in such a way that a creature of the specified type would be inside the area, the effect ends.</p> <p>As a Magic action, a creature within 5 feet of the Emanation can attempt to overcome it, which forces the creature to make a [[/save ability=cha dc=15 format=long]]. On a successful save, the creature ceases to be affected by the Emanation.</p>",
          "priority": null
        },
        {
          "key": "system.properties",
